## 🌟 Features

✨ **Real-Time Multi-Class Detection** using YOLOv5s (80 COCO classes)  
⚡ **Adjustable Confidence Threshold** via interactive GUI slider  
🖥️ **Modern Desktop Application** built with Python Tkinter  
🔄 **Threaded Processing** for smooth UI performance  
🌈 **Color-Coded Visualization** for different object types  
📊 **Detection Summary Panel** showing live object counts  

