## 🏗️ System Architecture

```
📹 Webcam Input
    ↓
🧠 YOLOv5 Model Processing
    ↓
🎯 Non-Max Suppression (NMS)
    ↓
🎨 Bounding Box Visualization
    ↓
🖥️ Tkinter GUI Display
    ↓
📊 Statistics Update
```

**Processing Pipeline:**
1. **Webcam** captures live video frames (OpenCV)
2. **YOLOv5** processes each frame for object detection  
3. **NMS filtering** removes duplicate/overlapping detections
4. **Visualization** draws colored bounding boxes with labels
5. **GUI update** displays results in Tkinter interface
6. **Statistics** show object counts and performance metrics

