## ⚙️ Configuration

### Model Options:
```python
# Available YOLOv5 variants
'yolov5s'  # ⚡ Fastest (recommended for real-time)
'yolov5m'  # 🔄 Balanced speed/accuracy  
'yolov5l'  # 🎯 Higher accuracy
'yolov5x'  # 🏆 Maximum accuracy (slower)
```

### Detection Settings:
```python
confidence_threshold = 0.65    # Detection confidence (0.1-1.0)
iou_threshold = 0.45          # Overlap threshold for NMS
max_detections = 1000         # Maximum objects per frame
device = 'cpu'                # Use 'cuda' for GPU acceleration
```

